  "body": "<!-- ------------------------------------------------------------------------ -->\r\n<!-- Please asssign the release coordinator (probably yourself) to this issue -->\r\n<!-- ------------------------------------------------------------------------ -->\r\n\r\nDate: **Thursday, June 20, 2024** \r\nPrevious release: https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/issues/1743\r\n\r\nPreflight checklist ([release steps](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/blob/main/meta/releasing.md)):\r\n\r\n* [x] Ensure the social media account holders are available for the release day.\r\n* [x] Blog post written\r\n* [x] Check for release blockers that may have been missed\r\n* [x] Review/fix the changelog\r\n\r\nRelease checklist ([release steps](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/blob/main/meta/releasing.md)):\r\n* [x] Branch stuffs\r\n* [x] Github release artifact\r\n* [x] Published to spec.matrix.org\r\n* [x] All links work\r\n* [x] Publish blog post\r\n* [x] Announce in #matrix-spec, client developers, HS developers, SCT office, and other rooms as warranted\r\n* [x] Post to Twitter/Mastodon\r\n* [x] Close this issue\r\n\r\nKnown release blockers:\r\n* [x] https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/pull/1858\r\n* [x] https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/pull/1884\r\n* [x] https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/pull/1883\r\n* [x] https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/pull/1882\r\n* [x] https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/pull/1881\r\n* [x] https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/pull/1880\r\n* [x] https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/pull/1885",
